### LinkPulse Links API Examples (VS Code REST Client format)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@linkId = clzlink0000108l8d1e2f3g4

### 1. Create a shortened link (Auto-generated code)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/links
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "destinationUrl": "https://example.com/blog/getting-started-2026",
  "tagNames": ["blog", "onboarding"]
}

### 2. Create a shortened link with custom alias, password, and click limit
# Note: Aliases are automatically normalized to lowercase and matched case-insensitively
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/links
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "destinationUrl": "https://example.com/whitepaper-q1-2026",
  "code": "q1-report",
  "maxClicks": 250,
  "password": "securepassword123",
  "tagNames": ["finance", "reports"]
}

### 3. List links with pagination and search
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/links?page=1&pageSize=20&search=report

### 4. List links filtered by status and tag
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/links?status=ACTIVE&tag=finance

### 5. Get a single link by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/links/{{linkId}}

### 6. Update a link destination and toggle status
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/links/{{linkId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "destinationUrl": "https://example.com/updated-whitepaper-2026",
  "status": "DISABLED"
}

### 7. Soft-delete a link
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/links/{{linkId}}

### 8. Live check alias availability and URL validity
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/links/check?alias=q1-report&url=https://example.com/promo
